msgstr "%d av %d"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7727
msgid "Slow pointer button"
msgstr "Knapp for treg peker"

#. Keep the space at the start or end: the text is joined to another.
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7731
msgid "    Slower by"
msgstr "    Tregere med"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7736
msgid "Click"
msgstr "Klikk"

#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7739
msgid "Slows the pointer"
msgstr "Senker farten"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7741
msgid "On-screen keyboard"
msgstr "Skjermtastatur"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7749
msgid "Reset to default"
msgstr "Tilbakestill til standard"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7752
msgid "Save as my mapping"
msgstr "Lagre som min tilordning"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7755
msgid "Use my mapping"
msgstr "Bruk min tilordning"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7767
msgid "Choose a key"
msgstr "Velg tast"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7767 title/pc5_ui.c:9244
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Tilbakestill"

#. A menu row's name (about 30 characters fit).
#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7768 title/pc5_ui.c:8812 title/pc5_ui.c:8883
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Lagre"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7768
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Bruk"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7789
#, c-format
msgid "What %s sends"
msgstr "Hva %s sender"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7807
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr "Den vanlige måten for eldre spill som dette, med deres 2D og 3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7808
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, with OpenGL ready in case the game asks for "
"it. Leave it here unless the game won't start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7809
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Raskest, og det de fleste spill vil ha. La den stå, med mindre spillet "
"ikke starter eller bildet blir feil."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7811
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, without OpenGL. For a game that starts or "
"draws worse with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7813
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"En annen måte å tegne spillet på, tregere enn Auto. Prøv den hvis spillet "
"ikke starter eller bildet blir feil."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7815
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Tegner alt i 2D, slik vanlige Windows-programmer tegnes. For et 2D-spill "
"som flimrer eller bare viser en del av skjermen sin; et spill med "
"3D-scener starter ikke med den."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7817
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong with Auto; "
"faster than Compatibility. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"En annen måte å tegne spillet på. Prøv den hvis bildet blir feil med Auto; "
"raskere enn Kompatibel. Noen modder trenger den."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7818
msgid ""
"The slowest, but it starts the most games. Try it if the game won't start "
"with the others."
msgstr ""
"Tregest, men starter flest spill. Prøv den hvis spillet ikke starter med "
"de andre."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7839
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "Spillet bruker %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7851
msgid "In use"
msgstr "I bruk"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7871
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 kjører PC-spillene dine med prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 "
"til 11, VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12 og Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for "
"OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7873
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
"with your key. No game is part of PC5."
msgstr ""
"Omslagene kommer fra Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki og Wikidata, og SteamGridDB "
"med nøkkelen din. Ingen spill er en del av PC5."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7874
msgid "Free software under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later."
msgstr "Fri programvare under GNU LGPL 2.1 eller nyere."

#. About PC5: the version (2.0.7 · PPSA11018).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7883
#, c-format
msgid "version %s"
msgstr "versjon %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7889
msgid "Like PC5?"
msgstr "Liker du PC5?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7892
msgid "Buy me a coffee"
msgstr "Spander en kaffe på meg"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7896
#, c-format
msgid "Games are kept in %.150s"
msgstr "Spillene lagres i %.150s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7900
#, c-format
msgid "%s free on the console"
msgstr "%s ledig på konsollen"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7965
msgid "INSTALL folder"
msgstr "INSTALL-mappen"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7967
#, c-format
